{"id":2351,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"微软雅黑\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} h1{ mso-style-name:\"标题 1\"; mso-style-next:正文; margin-top:5.0000pt; margin-bottom:5.0000pt; mso-margin-top-alt:auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto; mso-pagination:none; text-align:left; font-family:宋体; font-weight:bold; font-size:24.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;} h2{ mso-style-name:\"标题 2\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-next:正文; margin-top:5.0000pt; margin-bottom:5.0000pt; mso-margin-top-alt:auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto; mso-pagination:none; text-align:left; font-family:宋体; font-weight:bold; font-size:18.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.vsb_15{ font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;} p.p{ mso-style-name:\"普通\\(网站\\)\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>春风浩荡催奋进，学风蔚然启新程。2026年4月7日下午4时，机械工程学院在科艺苑隆重召开2026年学风建设大会暨“榜样为炬·智骋青春”事迹报告会。机械工程学院院党委书记孙旭东、院长祝锡晶、科研副院长叶林征、机械工程与自动化系系主任杜文华、舰船与防务工程系系主任鲁辉虎、全体辅导员、班主任及各年级学生代表，获奖集体和个人参加大会。大会由院党委副书记李晓杰主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8o77iYM8VRU8M2LDlU8nNCsLNUDMRLsPo7rkMmffolUsnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyinSh7MSyZnmAfoRLaLm6VMRnfMRA2UzNZLzQ7LNr7UNVFM4CDnl-8MRWFn7CbLkbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D5ED58F8A83027E44A48FA9816D2EDBA/766EB442/DF90\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"342\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8o77iYM8VRU8M2LDlU8nNCsLNUDMRLsPo7rkMmffolUsnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyinSh7MSyZnmAfoRLaLm6VMRnfMRA2UzNZLzQ7LNr7UNVFM4CDnl-8MRWFn7CbLkbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>大会在庄严的国歌声中拉开帷幕。院党委书记孙旭东发表讲话。他指出，本次大会承载着三重深远意义：一是承前启后的“总结检阅”与“战略动员”；二是党建引领、铸魂育人的“生动实践”；三是激发创新潜能、锻造时代新人的“奋进号角”。孙旭东书记强调，学风建设人人有责、人人受益，希望全体教师做“四有”好老师，受表彰集体和个人发挥榜样表率作用，全体同学以先进为标杆，珍惜韶华、潜心问学，将个人理想融入时代洪流。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8UmNiZUNV2MmQRUDz9ZnzG8L4TfMlMsRnRvYLRNbL4WfMml0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybLSyPnShVolCZL4-4Mmv4nllan7UaMlMRMRC4MmC8nRfFM4vYnlCan7MFUzT2n1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F911EE9F8323673EE0DD05CC463664D0/772EF0DC/A9FF\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"341\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8UmNiZUNV2MmQRUDz9ZnzG8L4TfMlMsRnRvYLRNbL4WfMml0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybLSyPnShVolCZL4-4Mmv4nllan7UaMlMRMRC4MmC8nRfFM4vYnlCan7MFUzT2n1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>院党委副书记李晓杰代表学院作2025年学风建设总结及2026年学风建设部署。过去一年，学院构建“党建引领、三全育人、数智赋能、五育并举”育人体系，依托“一站式”社区深化协同育人，打造“高数小讲师”“最美笔记”等品牌活动，健全学业预警与“托底工程”帮扶机制，学风持续向好。2026年，学院将持续深化学风建设，完善学业预警与帮扶机制，推动学风建设向“重质量”“促发展”转变。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8L4viiUNliU4VfMDmWfnRWVL8LDUmnskMm-sLNUYMRCiU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7Mky8n1yPUzVkLmT2Mm62LzVVLRCbUN7sLmW2nRA2L7rFMlLbMmGZMmTFolM7oSbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9D44F1A1B29F67F11E069BA722FD8F0E/5C960869/9CD9\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"341\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8L4viiUNliU4VfMDmWfnRWVL8LDUmnskMm-sLNUYMRCiU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7Mky8n1yPUzVkLmT2Mm62LzVVLRCbUN7sLmW2nRA2L7rFMlLbMmGZMmTFolM7oSbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>大会对2025年校院两级先进个人和先进集体进行了隆重表彰。鲁辉虎主任宣读对2025年院级各类先进个人的表彰决定、杜文华主任宣读对2025年校级各类先进个人的表彰决定，叶林征副院长宣读对2025年校院各级先进集体的表彰决定。获奖代表依次上台领奖，现场掌声雷动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8nmNi8nmlaL4G8oDzviUm98M8lbMmLsbMNUiUlUaU4G4Lz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyanShfLkyZM8UbL4LsL8Q2nlWkMzLbU4WfozlsnNCZnm6FUNWkL4LiM4TFnzQRM1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/00EA087D93373FFEBB539C2A957FF8F7/BBB33579/E6C6\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"341\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8nmNi8nmlaL4G8oDzviUm98M8lbMmLsbMNUiUlUaU4G4Lz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyanShfLkyZM8UbL4LsL8Q2nlWkMzLbU4WfozlsnNCZnm6FUNWkL4LiM4TFnzQRM1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>院长祝锡晶教授在讲话中向全体师生致以诚挚问候，向受表彰集体和个人表示热烈祝贺。他全面回顾了过去一年学院在学风建设、科学研究、教育教学、人才队伍、团学工作、人才培养等方面取得的标志性成果：科研经费突破4000万元，同比增长32.3%；获批国家级、省部级及国防科研项目多项；学科竞赛获国家级奖项115项、省部级270项；2025届总体就业率84.5%，升学率29.39%，多名学子保研至顶尖高校。祝锡晶院长对同学们提出三点希望：一是立志拔尖成才，勇担时代使命；二是勤学善思，锤炼过硬本领；三是勇于创新，激发发展潜能。他强调，学风建设永远在路上，要以本次大会为新起点，以奋斗为底色，书写机械工程学院崭新篇章。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8MlUi8MRUiolLiUDmA7LzGbnllaUl7siLzWRUll8nR7aMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4M1hkoSh7nNWfLmlZM8CZnl74LNLPUmvbUmlbUzW2M7VFMN-bLm67L4rFolQVL1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C36B9DFBA2587F8EA32C1B79B59A2F4A/6B927D35/9FE2\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"341\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8MlUi8MRUiolLiUDmA7LzGbnllaUl7siLzWRUll8nR7aMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4M1hkoSh7nNWfLmlZM8CZnl74LNLPUmvbUmlbUzW2M7VFMN-bLm67L4rFolQVL1baptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>全体参会学生在院学生会副主席陈梦凯领誓下庄严宣誓，铿锵誓言激励同学们将誓言内化于心、外化于行。</p><p>学风建设大会结束后，“榜样为炬·智骋青春”事迹报告会正式开讲。“机械之星”风采展集中展示了优秀学子的奋斗足迹；研究生支教团代表翟慧超分享支教故事，诠释青春担当；校长奖章获得者郭子峤讲述保研名校的拼搏历程；五四红旗团支部22020401团支部作集体事迹报告，展现团结奋进、比学赶超的青春风貌。榜样们用真实经历诠释了“博学厚德、精机善械”的机械精神，引发全场强烈共鸣。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8UNWi7LNC4MzWRLD4GPoRrfUmWfUlCs4Mz-inNQfol-ZL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysMkyPLkybn7-iUl-aLl7ZUz98n7QRU4GaU87boR9bUzrFU4GaM7QkozAFnRQ2nkbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/974109DB5AB01A8A84DFCC00CA9889A5/C004FB98/D6FD\" vheight=\"227\" vwidth=\"340\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8UNWi7LNC4MzWRLD4GPoRrfUmWfUlCs4Mz-inNQfol-ZL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysMkyPLkybn7-iUl-aLl7ZUz98n7QRU4GaU87boR9bUzrFU4GaM7QkozAFnRQ2nkbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>风好正是扬帆时，奋楫逐浪天地宽。全体师生将以此次大会为契机、以榜样为炬，以智慧为帆，在“双一流”建设征程中勇毅前行，共同建设一个更加美好奋进的机械工程学院！</p><p>一审一校/韩佳明</p><p>二审二校/王浩然</p><p>三审三校/李宗霖</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8o77iYM8VRU8M2LDlU8nNCsLNUDMRLsPo7rkMmffolUsnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyinSh7MSyZnmAfoRLaLm6VMRnfMRA2UzNZLzQ7LNr7UNVFM4CDnl-8MRWFn7CbLkbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4LbozvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=33997&e=.png"}